      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## SeedVR2 Retouch for Any Image (2BZ · toobusy 0.5.4)\n\n**Put an image in ① and just run.** No prompt. A single photo or an 18MP character sheet, as is.\nAdds **fine texture only** to plastic-looking skin, mushy hair and fabric in AI images. Shape, face and color stay as in the original.\n\n### Two outputs\n- **High** `seedvr2_high` — rest 1.25 / skin 1.0 → crisp hair, fabric, metal\n- **Low** `seedvr2_low` — rest 1.0 / skin 0.9 → natural (use this if faces look older)\n- Going below strength 0.9 actually makes it softer than the original.\n\n### Out of VRAM? → lower only `tile_megapixels` in ③\n| GPU VRAM | tile_megapixels |\n|---|---|\n| 8GB | 1.0 |\n| 12GB | 1.5 – 2 |\n| 16GB | 2 – 3 |\n| 24GB | 3 – 4 |\n\nLarge images are restored in tiles of this size and stitched. Lowering it keeps quality nearly the same, just more tiles and a bit slower.\n`upscale_small_to` (default 3) — smaller images are enlarged, restored, then returned to original size. Face texture peaks at 2–3MP.\nThe Info node shows input size and tile count.\n\n### Skin not detected?\nChange `skin:8` in ④ to `face:4, hand:4, neck:4`. For sheets with many people use `skin:16`. Check the mask in the preview on the right.\n\n### Models (click to download)\n- [seedvr2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SeedVR2/resolve/main/diffusion_models/seedvr2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors) → `models/diffusion_models/`\n- [seedvr2_ema_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SeedVR2/resolve/main/vae/seedvr2_ema_vae_fp16.safetensors) → `models/vae/`\n- [sam3.1_multiplex_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/sam3.1/resolve/main/checkpoints/sam3.1_multiplex_fp16.safetensors) → `models/checkpoints/`\n- If 3B errors, update ComfyUI or switch to [7B int8](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SeedVR2/resolve/main/diffusion_models/seedvr2_7b_int8_convrot.safetensors) (nearly identical results).\n\n### Required nodes\n- **toobusy 0.5.4+** (search `toobusy` in ComfyUI Manager)\n- SeedVR2, SAM3 and the rest are **ComfyUI core nodes** (latest ComfyUI)\n"
      ],
      "title": "⓪ Read me first"
    }
